        for (int j=0; j<categories.getLength(); j++) {
            Element cat = (Element) categories.item(j);
            String name = cat.getAttributeNS(ANDROID_URI, ATTR_NAME);
            if ("android.intent.category.LEANBACK_LAUNCHER".equals(name)) return true;
        }
    }
    return false;
}
```

