Let's construct helper method `isBodyAlwaysTrue(UMethod method)`. Implementation:

```
private static boolean isBodyAlwaysTrue(UMethod method) {
    UExpression body = method.getUastBody();
    if (body == null) return false;
    final AtomicBoolean foundReturn = new AtomicBoolean(false);
    final AtomicBoolean allTrue = new AtomicBoolean(true);
    body.accept(new AbstractUastVisitor() {
        @Override
        public boolean visitReturnExpression(UReturnExpression node) {
            foundReturn.set(true);
            UExpression returnValue = node.getReturnExpression();
            if (returnValue instanceof ULiteralExpression) {
                Object value = ((ULiteralExpression) returnValue).getValue();
                if (value == Boolean.TRUE) {
                    return super.visitReturnExpression(node);
                }
            }
            allTrue.set(false);
            return super.visitReturnExpression(node);
        }
    });
    return foundReturn.get() && allTrue.get();
}
```

